OL,3,GNEWSAFrom fan art to Star Wars: the
OL,4,Aposter artist behind Marvel and Disney
OL,5,Ahits
OL,6,
OL,7,FA film fan who began creating his own
OL,8,Fmovie poster artwork for fun has gone
OL,9,Fon to work on some of Hollywood's
OL,10,Fbiggest franchises, including Marvel,
OL,11,FIndiana Jones and Star Wars.
OL,13,FPaul Shipper said he was spotted after
OL,14,Fsharing designs online, leading to
OL,15,Fopportunities that once felt like "a
OL,16,Fdream", inspired by the films of George
OL,17,FLucas and Steven Spielberg.
