OL,3,GNEWSAFrom fan art to Star Wars: the
OL,4,Aposter artist behind Marvel and Disney
OL,5,Ahits
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmong the projects he has worked on are
OL,8,Fposters and artwork for blockbuster
OL,9,Ftitles including Avengers: Infinity
OL,10,FWar, Doctor Strange, Star Wars: The
OL,11,FRise of Skywalker, Star Wars: The Last
OL,12,FJedi, Obi-Wan Kenobi and Skeleton Crew.
OL,14,FThe illustrator said becoming a movie
OL,15,Fposter artist had originally seemed a
OL,16,Flong way off, before the early days of
OL,17,Fthe internet helped his work find an
OL,18,Faudience.
